"jari" <jari@mad.servicom.es> writes:

>Does anyone know why whenever I click on the lower edge of the book to get
>the knight
>( in the chess book), it gives me an unknown error-6 ? 
>	

It's because you don't have enough free memory. If you read the README.TXT
is says it requires 560Kb to run. This is true! It will work with a lesser
memory amount, but at certain points in the game it does require the full
560Kb, and if it can't allocate that much, it will bomb out.

PS: The amount may not be 560Kb... check the README.TXT... in any case,
free up more memory or make a bootdisk.

